config BR2_PACKAGE_QOBINE
    bool "qobine (Qobuz Connect, open source)"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_RUSTC_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_RUSTC
    select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
    select BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSL
    help
      Open source Qobuz Connect renderer (SofusA/qobine, connect-module,
      binary qobine-connect). Installed as /usr/lib/qobine/qobuz-connect:
      the process name stays "qobuz-connect", so service detection works.
      Chosen instead of the SDK player by /etc/digifox/qobuz-engine = qobine.
      https://github.com/SofusA/qobine
